#: ../src/dialog_video_properties.cpp:162
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The video you have loaded has no specified color matrix. Aegisub will guess the color matrix to be %s, but there is no guarantee that other programs will guess the same matrix. This may make the video appear with different colors in different media players and can prevent subtitle colors from matching video colors.\n"
" \n"
"Consider tagging your video with a color matrix to ensure that your video displays consistently in all players and that subtitle colors can reliably match video colors."
msgstr ""
"Videon du har öppnat saknar uppgift om färgmatris. Aegisub antar att färgmatrisen är %s, men andra program kan välja en annan matris. Videons färger kan då skilja sig åt mellan olika mediespelare och undertextens färger kan avvika från videons.\n"
" \n"
"Ange en färgmatris i videons metadata så att färgerna visas likadant i alla spelare och undertextens färger kan matchas mot videons."

#: ../src/dialog_video_properties.cpp:167
msgid "Untagged video"
msgstr "Videon saknar uppgift om färgmatris"

#: ../src/dialog_video_properties.cpp:172
msgid ""
"The video you have loaded has HDR and/or WCG colors. While ordinary dialogue"
" subtitles will work fine on such videos, matching video colors using "
"subtitles will not be possible on HDR and/or WCG footage."
msgstr ""
"Videon du har öppnat har högt dynamiskt omfång (HDR), stort färgomfång (WCG)"
" eller båda delarna. Vanliga dialogundertexter fungerar, men undertextens "
"färger kan inte matchas mot videons färger i sådant material."

#: ../src/dialog_video_properties.cpp:175
msgid "HDR and/or WCG video"
msgstr "Video med HDR eller WCG"

#: ../src/dialog_video_properties.cpp:188
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The current subtitle file has no YCbCr Matrix set.\n"
"\n"
"If you plan to use this subtitle file on this newly loaded video file,\n"
"you should set the subtitle file's YCbCr Matrix to the video's color space (\"%s\").\n"
"\n"
"If you plan to use a different video file, you may want to\n"
"leave the YCbCr Matrix unset until you load the correct video file.\n"
"\n"
"This prompt can be configured in the preferences."
msgstr ""
"Den aktuella undertextfilen saknar YCbCr-matris.\n"
"\n"
"Om du tänker använda undertextfilen med videon du just har öppnat\n"
"bör du ställa in undertextfilens YCbCr-matris efter videons färgrymd (”%s”).\n"
"\n"
"Om du tänker använda en annan video kan du vänta med att ange\n"
"YCbCr-matrisen tills du har öppnat rätt video.\n"
"\n"
"Du kan välja när frågan ska visas i inställningarna."

#: ../src/dialog_video_properties.cpp:193
msgid "Set script's YCbCr Matrix?"
msgstr "Ange undertextfilens YCbCr-matris?"

#: ../src/dialog_video_properties.cpp:194
msgid "Leave YCbCr Matrix unset"
msgstr "Lämna YCbCr-matrisen ospecificerad"

#: ../src/dialog_video_properties.cpp:194
#: ../src/dialog_video_properties.cpp:253
#, c-format
msgid "Set script's YCbCr Matrix to the video's (\"%s\")"
msgstr "Använd videons YCbCr-matris för undertextfilen (”%s”)"

#: ../src/dialog_video_properties.cpp:248
#, c-format
msgid ""
"This video's recommended YCbCr Matrix (\"%s\") differs from the subtitle file's YCbCr Matrix (\"%s\").\n"
"\n"
"If this new video's colors look identical to the video the subtitle file was originally authored for,\n"
"then the subtitle file's YCbCr Matrix should be set to the video's YCbCr Matrix."
msgstr ""
"Videons rekommenderade YCbCr-matris (”%s”) skiljer sig från undertextfilens (”%s”).\n"
"\n"
"Om videons färger ser likadana ut som i videon som undertextfilen skapades för\n"
"bör du använda den nya videons YCbCr-matris för undertextfilen."

#: ../src/dialog_video_properties.cpp:252
msgid "YCbCr Matrix mismatch"
msgstr "Olika YCbCr-matriser"

