#: ../src/dialog_video_properties.cpp:346
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The resolution of the loaded video and the resolution specified for the subtitles don't match.\n"
"\n"
"Video resolution:\t%d × %d\n"
"Script resolution:\t%d × %d\n"
"\n"
"Change subtitles resolution to match video?"
msgstr ""
"Videons upplösning skiljer sig från den som anges i undertextfilen.\n"
"\n"
"Videons upplösning:\t%d × %d\n"
"Undertextfilens upplösning:\t%d × %d\n"
"\n"
"Vill du anpassa undertextens upplösning till videons?"

#: ../src/dialog_video_properties.cpp:350
msgid "Resolution mismatch"
msgstr "Olika upplösningar"

#: ../src/dialog_video_properties.cpp:397
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The current subtitle file has no layout resolution set.\n"
"\n"
"If you plan to use this subtitle file on this newly loaded video file,\n"
"you should set the subtitle file's layout resolution to the video's display resolution.\n"
"\n"
"If you plan to use a different video file, you may want to leave\n"
"the layout resolution unset until you load the correct video file.\n"
"\n"
"If you are adapting an existing old subtitle file that does not yet have\n"
"a layout resolution set, you should set its layout resolution to the resolution\n"
"of the video the subtitle file was intended to be played back on.\n"
"Often, this is the same as the file's script resolution. (%d × %d)\n"
"\n"
"This prompt can be configured in the preferences."
msgstr ""
"Den aktuella undertextfilen saknar layoutupplösning.\n"
"\n"
"Om du tänker använda undertextfilen med videon du just har öppnat\n"
"bör du ange videons visningsupplösning som layoutupplösning.\n"
"\n"
"Om du tänker använda en annan video kan du vänta med att ange\n"
"layoutupplösningen tills du har öppnat rätt video.\n"
"\n"
"Om du anpassar en äldre undertextfil som saknar layoutupplösning\n"
"bör du välja upplösningen för den video som undertexten\n"
"ursprungligen var avsedd för. Ofta är den densamma som undertextfilens\n"
"angivna upplösning (%d × %d).\n"
"\n"
"Du kan välja när frågan ska visas i inställningarna."

