msgstr ""
"Använd undertextfilens angivna upplösning som layoutupplösning (%d × %d)"

#: ../src/dialog_video_properties.cpp:472
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The resolution of the loaded video and the layout resolution specified for the subtitles don't match.\n"
"\n"
"Video resolution:    %d × %d\n"
"Subtitle layout resolution:    %d × %d\n"
"\n"
"Usually, this is not an issue, and you may leave the subtitle file's layout resolution as it is.\n"
