#: ../src/export_framerate.cpp:52
msgid "Transform Framerate"
msgstr "Ändra bildfrekvens"

#: ../src/export_framerate.cpp:53
msgid ""
"Transform subtitle times, including those in override tags, from an input framerate to an output framerate.\n"
"\n"
"This is useful for converting regular time subtitles to VFRaC time subtitles for hardsubbing.\n"
"It can also be used to convert subtitles to a different speed video, such as NTSC to PAL speedup."
msgstr ""
"Räknar om undertextens tider från en bildfrekvens till en annan, även i åsidosättningstaggar.\n"
"\n"
"På så sätt kan du konvertera vanliga undertexttider till VFRaC-tider för att bränna in undertexten i videon.\n"
